  "notes": [
    "Text extraction rendered the 'ff'/'fi'/'fl' ligatures as single Unicode glyphs (U+FB00-FB02); they are written here as plain letters ('Jafferkhanpet'). No other spelling was changed; source typos are kept (e.g. 'Kaliammn', 'Conservany', 'Commmunity', 'Govidasamy', 'Khau Nagar', 'KumaranVolony', 'Posatal Colony', 'Modal House Road').",
    "Both heavy-rain 'water stagnated streets' tables (p.570, 8 rows, previous monsoon; p.571-573, 35 rows, monsoon 2015) carry pump capacity, pump location and disposal point, so they are in inundation_streets (max_depth and days_to_drain are not given in this zone). Some streets appear in both tables (e.g. North Usman Road / Northusman Road, Rajamannar Salai). The pump cell for North Usman Road on p.570 is printed '3 Nos of H.P' (horsepower missing in the source); p.573 gives '3- 10 H.P' for the same street.",
    "water_stagnation holds only the 'Stagnation of water in streets due to sewer blocks in 2015' table (p.577-578), one entry per ward row; the per-row manhole counts (total 437) are not captured. No mild/moderate rain tables exist in this zone.",
    "Relief centres: the table marks Drinking water YES, Toilets YES, Cooking facilities NO for all 7 centres, which contradicts the intro text ('readily available with cooking, drinking water and toilet facilities'). The table values are used. Column assignment was confirmed against the source PDF layout. The intro says total capacity 3250; the rows sum to 3250.",
    "Relief centre contact designations carry the responsibility from the 'Responsibilities' column in parentheses; the Assistant Engineer number appears twice per centre (Evacuation and Relief Materials) as printed. The Assistant Revenue Officer number 9445190090 is the same for every centre.",
    "Sanitary Officer U-31 is printed as 9445025471, breaking the 944519046x/0470 pattern of U-28..U-30; kept as printed. Electrical Additional Divisional Engineer 9445190050 is listed twice (engineering wing and lighting tables) and both rows are kept.",
    "Conservancy supervisor units conflict between tables: p.561 gives 9445191429 for wards 127-132,134,135 and 9445191430 for 133,136-142; the TNSCB contacts on p.565 give 9445191430 for U-28 & 30 and 9445191429 for U-29 & 31. Both are kept as printed.",
    "The CMWSSB row in the TNSCB contacts table reads Designation 'Assistant Engineer', Area 'Area Engineer', so it is recorded with wards='Area Engineer' as printed.",
    "The NDRF Commandant phone is printed '04177 - 246594/246269'. The second number has no printed prefix and is given here as '04177-246269', assuming the shared STD code.",
    "Lighting-table phones were printed with a space (e.g. '94451 91453'); the space is removed and the digits are unchanged.",
    "Parks (p.563) list streets and parks together in one cell per ward. Rows are kept whole except where the cell pairs a named park with a road (ward 132 semicolon pairs, ward 136 Sivan Park, ward 140 Amma Park).",
    "Pumping stations are not tied to wards in the source (ward=null). Pump HP/Nos are not captured. The source total is '77Nos' pumps across 24 stations.",
    "No hospitals/UPHC table is in this zone appendix. There is no zonal office address.",
    "Less than 2.5 m streets that cannot be accessed by vehicles (p.589): 129/Saligramam: Thamba street, V.P.Agilan street, Shanmugasundaram Street 1st Lane, Shanmugasundaram Street 3rd Lane &Shanmugasundaram Street 4th Lane; 130/Vadapalani: Bakthavatchalam Colony 4th Lane; 131/K.K.Nagar: MGR Nagar Nedunchezian lane 1 to 10 lanes, MGR Nagar Anjugam cross street, Vijayaragavapuram Cross Street 1st Lane &Vijayaragavapuram 2nd lane; 132/Ashok Nagar: Ottagapalayam I to 13 street; 133/Ram Colony: Appasamy Lane, R.N.Nambiar Lane &Kasikulam Slum Ten Lanes; 137/K.K.Nagar: MGR Nagar Ponmanachemmal Street, Anbanandam 1st Street, Anbanandam 2nd Street,Anbanandam 3rd Street,Misha Abraham Cross Street,Choolai Street &MuthuramalingaDevar 1st and 2nd Street; 138/Jafferkhanpet: JafferkhanpetKanni 2nd Street,Pachaiappan 1st cross lane, MGR Nagar ZakirHussain 1st lane,MGR Nagar Pulithevan 1st cross lane,MGR Nagar Pulithevan 2nd cross lane,JafferkhanpetAyyavoo cross lane&Jafferkhanpet Gandhi 1st lane; 139/R.R.Colony: Elangovadigal street; 141/V.O.C.Nagar: South Dhandapani Street Lane.",
    "Not captured (no schema field): TNSCB tenements (15, pop. 39,098, p.565), canals/river/ponds (p.566-567), SWD lengths (p.569), lorries (p.589). The zone_10.txt ends with an empty '##### PDF page 599' marker; that page is blank in the source PDF too."
